     1382   PROCEDURE no-benq-i-office.
     1383   DEFINE OUTPUT PARAMETER found as logical init no.
     1384   define buffer buf_sale-doc for ub.sale-doc.
     1385   CASE X-Radio-Task > 1:
     1386     WHEN YES then do:
     1387       FOR EACH obj-list WHERE
     1388               obj-list.obj-type = 'маг':U NO-LOCK :
